{"tool_name":"imagej-plugin-for-non-local-means-filtering","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>A more modern approach for denoising / smoothening before segmentation, works like Gaussian blurring but preserves edges and boundaries. Listed in Fiji update sites. ## Algorithm Algorithm description is in [this page](<a href=\"http://www.ipol.im/pub/art/2011/bcm_nlm/\">http://www.ipol.im/pub/art/2011/bcm_nlm/</a>) 2612. ## Example usage Localization of Membrane bound protein in Arabidopsis meristem was analyzed using the non-local-mean filter for refining its position 2613. ## impression It's effect is somewhere between Gaussian blurring and anistropic diffusion.</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>A more modern approach for denoising / smoothening before segmentation, works like Gaussian blurring but preserves edges and boundaries. Listed in Fiji update sites. ## Algorithm Algorithm description is in [this page](http://www.ipol.im/pub/art/2011/bcm_nlm/) 2612. ## Example usage Localization of Membrane bound protein in Arabidopsis meristem was analyzed using the non-local-mean filter for refining its position 2613. ## impression It's effect is somewhere between Gaussian blurring and anistropic diffusion.</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2019-10-21T12:38:51+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2015-02-19T14:57:30+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":376,"comment_count":1,"last_comment_name":"","last_comment_timestamp":1523443708,"last_comment_uid":2800,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"Thorsten Wagner, Pascal Behnel"}],"has_biological_terms":[],"has_comparison":[],"has_documentation":[{"options":[],"title":"","uri":"https://imagej.net/Non_Local_Means_Denoise"}],"has_doi":[],"has_entry_curator":[{"target_id":94,"target_type":"user","target_uuid":"aa749c9e-5b9a